<section data-aud-show="b2c" class="section is-light"><div class="container"><div class="section_header is-tight"><h2 class="heading-h2">Your shop costs more time than it brings in.</h2><p class="text-lead">Most retailers struggle with the same problems. Not because they do anything wrong, but because their tools were not built for them.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Plugins and updates</h3><p class="card_text">Slow load times from too many plugins. Updates that regularly break things. Hosting and maintenance stay with you.</p><div class="pain-chip">Checkout down on Friday night</div></div><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">App fees and locked features</h3><p class="card_text">Ongoing costs for apps and fees, features only in expensive plans - and tools not designed for European requirements.</p><div class="pain-chip">One more app, one more fee</div></div><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Till, shop and marketplaces out of step</h3><p class="card_text">Each holds a different stock picture. Oversell in one place, empty shelves in another - with search, loyalty and social as extra tools.</p><div class="pain-chip">Five logins, five invoices, zero overview</div></div></div></div></section>